{"id":"n72144-1-11","stage":1,"title":"출장 · 出差","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72144-1-11-1","ko":"사장님을 좀 뵐 수 있을까요?","zh":"请问能见一下老板吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사장님을","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；님：尊称后缀。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뵐","meaning":"拜见","explanation":"뵈다：拜见；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"뵈다","audio":"/audio/a0aa3624cfc7caecc552.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62814","senseId":"1","lemma":"뵈다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을까요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"a0aa3624cfc7caec","term":"뵈다","zh":"拜见","audio":"/audio/a0aa3624cfc7caecc552.mp3","entryId":"62814","definition":"与长辈见面。","pronunciation":["뵈ː다","붸ː다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio